    "slug": "2024-impact-limb-occlusion-pressure-assessment-position-performance-cardiovascular",
    "title": "Impact of limb occlusion pressure assessment position on performance, cardiovascular, and perceptual responses in blood flow restricted low-load resistance exercise: A randomized crossover trial",
    "year": 2024,
